    key(p);
    label fr official "heures de travail sur la période de référence effective de trois ans, hors périodes de prestations exclues et, sur le parcours mixte, hors heures couvertes par l'assimilation TNS ou agricole (D. 262-25-1 al. 2 ; D. 262-25-4)";
    label en unofficial "hours worked over the effective three-year reference period, outside excluded benefit periods and, on the mixed path, outside hours covered by the self-employed or agricultural deeming (D. 262-25-1 al. 2; D. 262-25-4)";
